{"resourceIdentifier":"4182","resourceName":"Guantao Qingfeng Biological Manure Management Greenhouse Gas Emission Reduction Project","description":"The Guantao Qingfeng Biological Manure Management Greenhouse Gas Emission Reduction Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located in Guantao County, Handan City, Hebei Province of China, and is used to treat biomass waste such as swine, cattle, chicken and sheep manure from seven local farms and straw from process of local agricultural production generated. Project is owned by Guantao County Qingfeng Biotechnology Co. The purpose of this project activity is to avoid and reduce methane emissions to the atmosphere through aerobic composting of manure and biomass residue. \r\nLivestock and poultry manure is an important source of greenhouse gas emissions. In absence of the project to deal with manure, in order to consider the economy and convenience of the previous breeding enterprises in surrounding villages and towns, all the generated manure will rot in the uncovered anaerobic lagoon, and methane will be directly discharged into the atmosphere, without any methane recovery and destruction facilities. The biomass waste residue is left in the solid waste treatment plant (SWDS) for decay.\r\nThe project uses livestock and poultry excrement resources generated by local farming as raw materials, and uses biomass residues, straw and other wastes generated in local agricultural activities as auxiliary materials for aerobic composting treatment. \r\nThe annual feces treatment capacity is 80000 tons of swine manure, 18000 tons of cattle manure, 55000 tons of chicken manure, 12000 tons of sheep manure, 36000 tons of biomass waste residue, and produce approximately55000 tons of organic fertilizer every year. In the final production of organic fertilizer, some organic fertilizer will be distributed to nearby farmers for free, and some will be sold to local enterprises.\r\nThe project is estimated that average of 42175 t CO2e will be generated annually during the first 7-year accounting period. The total emission reduction is 295226 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":36.514229,"longitude":115.211888},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-07-18","endExclusive":"2023-08-18","endInclusive":"2023-08-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4182"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guantao County Qingfeng Biotechnology Co.,Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4182"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"35654"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"15/10/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 22/03/2022 - 21/03/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=87745&IDKEY=sq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfh8121000355","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_GT_PD.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-04T05:08:31.273Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=93261&IDKEY=8q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhs128606919","documentType":"Draft Project Description",